                        <tr>
                           <td>Detectable HIV-1 RNA viral load (37,735 copies/mL) is present, indicating active viral replication. This result suggests ongoing HIV infection and may be used to assess disease progression or response to antiretroviral therapy. Clinical correlation and further management are recommended.</td>
